Package: synveil
Version: @SYNVEIL_VERSION@
Architecture: @SYNVEIL_ARCH@
Maintainer: Synveil Project <synveil-dev@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SYNVEIL_INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SYNVEIL_DEPENDS@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Synveil desktop synchronization
 Install the Synveil desktop application and its background synchronization
 client. Open Synveil from the application menu after installation.
 .
 Installation does not start Synveil or configure a server. Background startup
 and maintenance are NOT auto-enabled. Runtime components are resolved by the
 native package manager.
